WEBVTT

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:05.759
Handoff needs a queue to hand to.

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:10.657
Under Interaction Center, Queues, click Add Queue and give it a name.

00:00:10.657 --> 00:00:12.812
Here it is the Sales queue.

00:00:13.264 --> 00:00:19.140
Under Hours and overflow, choose a business hours calendar, here the showroom hours.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.318
While the queue is closed, a call handed over is not held:

00:00:23.318 --> 00:00:25.799
a callback is scheduled instead.

00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:26.844
Then save.

